# Rumble Arena's "scry 1" lets the player keep the card on top (CR 701.22a): Bot1 leaves Lightning Bolt where it is, so the
# library is unchanged. The sibling scenario rumble-arena-scries-1-as-it-enters-has-vigilance-and-taps-for-colorless sends it
# to the bottom.

[Bot1 Deck]
Rumble Arena
Island x6
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Counterspell

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Rumble Arena.Play
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | )

[Expect]
Bot1.Library = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus; Counterspell
